Subject: [PATCH 64/97] mamba: reuse Mamba/GDN metadata across KV cache groups
 (port of upstream #58762)

Port of the upstream vLLM change #58762 (Apache-2.0). Mamba/GDN attention metadata is built once and reused by groups that share it.
Test-only conflicts with upstream changes not in v0.30.0 were resolved by taking only this change's tests.
